### Scenario 7 - cancel after payment: points, stock and credit are given back
### Run scenario 6 first, or create + pay an order here.

@order = http://localhost:8083
@customer = http://localhost:8082
@catalog = http://localhost:8081

# @name cart
POST {{order}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1 }

###
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "ELC-3002", "qty": 2 }

###
# @name checkout
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingMethod": "STANDARD" }

###
POST {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "CARD", "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "loyaltyPoints": 1000 }

### State before the cancellation
GET {{customer}}/customers/1/loyalty

###
GET {{catalog}}/products/ELC-3002

### Cancel: refund 142.24, 1000 points restituted, 118 earned points taken back, stock restocked
POST {{order}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/cancel

### State after: points back to the initial balance, stock +2
GET {{customer}}/customers/1/loyalty

###
GET {{catalog}}/products/ELC-3002

### A shipped order cannot be cancelled: create/pay/ship an order, then cancel -> 400
# POST {{order}}/orders/<id>/cancel
